<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription->[asker_nameFull]，[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle]，向我们发来了紧急情报。附近存在一个由鼠族军阀控制的农场。这座农场不仅生产着大量粮食，还作为军阀部队的后勤补给基地。[asker_nameDef]希望我们可以消灭所有敌人并解放这片农场的平民。</li>
  -->
  <RKU_OpportunitySite_FarmRaid.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>[asker_nameFull], the [asker_faction_leaderTitle] of [asker_faction_name], has sent us urgent intelligence. There is a farm controlled by Ratkin warlords nearby. This farm not only produces large quantities of food but also serves as a logistical supply base for the warlord forces. [asker_nameDef] hopes that we can eliminate all enemies and liberate the civilians in this farm.</RKU_OpportunitySite_FarmRaid.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
